### Admin / discovery endpoints
# Vars come from http-client.env.json (pick the "local" or "prod" env in your
# REST client). Inline defaults below keep the file runnable with no env set.

@host = {{host}}

### Root — advertises the api and which engines are registered
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health — liveness probe
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List every database across all engines
GET {{host}}/api/databases
Accept: application/json

### List databases for one engine only
GET {{host}}/api/postgres/list
Accept: application/json

### List for an engine with none provisioned (empty array, still 200)
GET {{host}}/api/mysql/list
Accept: application/json